  "_notes": [
    "The state this starts from is 02-two-lines-priced.json at version 12 — same transaction, same two lines.",
    "pendingConfirmation is null and lines are byte-identical to 02: the flip does not move the plant, so it does not re-price. A server that raises a storeChange confirm here has implemented CONTRACT.md §2.2 wrong.",
    "plant stays 1101 and plantSource stays 'derivedFromAddress' — that IS how the plant got there, and it is retained across the flip. This is also the open question 154 records: plantSource now does double duty and has no value meaning 'chosen for pickup'.",
    "header.address is null but the address is RETAINED in the CallCenterSession sidecar (CC2 keeps _lastAddress). Flipping back to Delivery restores it without re-keying and re-derives the plant through setAddress's existing confirm path. A server that clears it is the second likely mis-implementation.",
    "submitBlockers is empty: NO_ADDRESS and MISSING_SLOT do not apply to a pickup order.",
    "deliveryFee.amount is 0 by the predicate that already exists for the CallCenterOrder doctype (POSController.NewPos.cs:8977 — subSourceCarriesFee && isDelivery && underThreshold), not by a new rule. thresholdGross is still quoted because the threshold is real: POSCommon.ShippingMinimumAmount."
  ]
